WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.943
The disability benefits backlog.

00:00:01.943 --> 00:00:06.386
Only forty-seven percent of applications now meet the sixteen-week standard.

00:00:06.386 --> 00:00:11.488
The backlog doubled from five thousand six hundred to over eleven thousand in a single year.
